     screen in the mode whose whole purpose is to give the map the screen.
     Capped so the search row is always visible and the rest is one scroll
     away, which keeps the thing that was missing and gives the map back
     the space. */
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    :global(.ra-bar.ra-fs-bar) { max-height: 96px; }
  }
  /* AND THE EXIT PILL MOVES OUT OF ITS WAY. It used to sit top-right, which
     is exactly where the bar's own buttons now are; the two overlapped. The
     phone layout had already put it at the bottom for the same reason. */
  :global(body.ra-fs-on #ra-fs-esc) { top: auto;
    bottom: calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px) + 16px); right: 18px;
    /* The phone rule centres it with a translate. This wins on specificity
